flowchart TD
    Start([Request arrives]):::start --> Valid{Payload valid?}:::decision
    Valid -->|no| Reject[400 Bad request]:::error
    Valid -->|yes| Persist[(Write draft)]:::data
    Persist --> RenderPipeline[["Render pipeline (detail)"]]:::async
    RenderPipeline --> Ok[200 OK]:::terminal
    RenderPipeline -->|renderer error| Fail[502 Render failed]:::error
    Reject --> End([Response sent]):::terminal
    Ok --> End
    Fail --> End

    click RenderPipeline "02-render-pipeline.mmd" "Open the render pipeline detail"

    %% Palette: TEST OVERRIDE — every class is neon pink, so class carries no meaning here.
    %% The seven class names are kept only so the override is a one-block revert.
    classDef start fill:#ff2fd0,stroke:#d1009f,color:#111111
    classDef decision fill:#ff2fd0,stroke:#d1009f,color:#111111
    classDef error fill:#ff2fd0,stroke:#d1009f,stroke-width:2px,color:#111111
    classDef data fill:#ff2fd0,stroke:#d1009f,color:#111111
    classDef async fill:#ff2fd0,stroke:#d1009f,stroke-dasharray:6 3,color:#111111
    classDef process fill:#ff2fd0,stroke:#d1009f,color:#111111
    classDef terminal fill:#ff2fd0,stroke:#d1009f,color:#111111
